WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.160
Hello everybody! My name is Markiplier and welcome back to Subnautica.

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:05.080
Now, I know some of you were probably worried that..

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:12.140
I wasn't gonna come back because I'd lost my mind, stripped naked, and ran off to an island to live by myself for the end of my days.

00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:14.500
But, uh, a few flaws with that plan..

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.560
I don't wanna go out in the ocean to live on an island.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:19.680
And number two.. I'm a bit stronger than that.

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:21.680
Generally speaking, I kinda have an idea of what--

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:23.800
Oohh, I'm in the shallows aren't I?

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:27.900
OHH!! Well, hello everybody! I don't think I was supposed to be here.

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:29.660
Ah, sh*tty tits.

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:32.020
Hang on, let me navigate some bullsh*t here.

00:00:32.020 --> 00:00:37.400
Soooo, yeahhhh. I know things may have gotten heated a little bit in the last episode..

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:43.400
But that's okay. I'm alright and everyone else here is happy. Given that there's no one.. what the f*ck?

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:47.420
Did I just.. F*cking God Dammit! Alright, did I just...

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:50.080
did I...

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:53.500
Did I just beach my god damn BIG BOX BARRY!

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:54.380
Son of an a$$!

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:56.240
Oh, come ON!

00:00:56.880 --> 00:00:57.380
AAAHHHHH!

00:00:57.700 --> 00:00:58.200
F*ck!

00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:00.820
Okay! Hello, hi...

00:01:00.820 --> 00:01:02.160
Why are we flying now?

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:06.160
Well apparently... Big Box Barry is now flying.

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:10.180
Here we go... OK!

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:13.000
*crash*

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:14.260
Well...

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:16.440
That was a thing that happened.

00:01:16.820 --> 00:01:20.180
OOHH, this game is welcoming me back with open arms.

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:21.860
Definitely happy to be here.

00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:23.160
Thank you!

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:26.880
Little sea creatures that I'm going to eat and cook in that order.

00:01:27.140 --> 00:01:27.640
But!

00:01:27.640 --> 00:01:28.920
I am back in the game.

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:30.040
I feel better!

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:31.620
And in this episode..

00:01:31.620 --> 00:01:33.300
I know things are gonna go better because..

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:36.400
I am NOT going to be hunting for anything now!

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:41.080
So, I've got lockers to make but I don't have the necessary resources on my person to make them.

00:01:41.320 --> 00:01:43.460
I'll make them when I get back down..

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:44.780
And deliver Big..

00:01:45.220 --> 00:01:47.380
Box Barry where he's supposed to be.

00:01:47.380 --> 00:01:48.600
'SCUSE ME!

00:01:48.860 --> 00:01:51.540
BIG BOX BARRY COMIN' THROUGH!!

00:01:51.740 --> 00:01:54.060
NOBODY MIND ME!

00:01:54.060 --> 00:01:56.420
I am just making a delivery.

00:01:56.420 --> 00:01:57.840
HOOOONNK!

00:01:57.840 --> 00:02:00.020
HONKITY HONK HONK!!

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:02.340
'SCUSE ME!

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:04.460
Oh boy, I better not attract any more mates!

00:02:04.460 --> 00:02:05.920
I don't think Big Box Barry can..

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:08.100
afford more alimony.

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:11.220
Okay, so I'm gonna make my way back down into the depths because..

00:02:11.220 --> 00:02:16.620
if there isn't enough silver that I can get here I know that there's going to be larger deposits of it over there.

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:19.620
So it's just a matter of getting to it if I need it..

00:02:19.620 --> 00:02:21.480
and I'm pretty sure that I'm gonna need it.

00:02:21.480 --> 00:02:24.200
But I'm not a hundred percent sure if I need it right now...

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:26.220
and that's the defining feature here.

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:28.820
But, I've got to get back to my base..

00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:31.380
where I've got Warpers crawling all over me..

00:02:31.380 --> 00:02:35.400
but, at least, I have some semblance of control over my life.

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:38.400
And then I'm going to BUILD A MODIFICATION STATION!!!

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:39.060
Oh.. hi, honey!

00:02:39.240 --> 00:02:39.740
HEY!!!

00:02:39.740 --> 00:02:42.480
How's little old... Jeremy???

00:02:42.840 --> 00:02:45.000
Is he good? That's not his name!? OH, OKAY!!

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:46.740
His name is BLEUGHERRR!!!

00:02:47.220 --> 00:02:47.980
I didn't know that!

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:49.640
I wasn't around....

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:51.900
I'm speaking for Big Box Barry here...

00:02:51.920 --> 00:02:52.420
but...

00:02:52.780 --> 00:02:54.760
somehow I feel like a parental figure.

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:58.380
So, oddly enough I've gotten another problem that's actually kinda significant here.

00:02:58.600 --> 00:03:01.340
I don't have much power left.

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:06.600
And apparently, the charging methods by which to charge my Big Box Barry..

00:03:06.860 --> 00:03:07.680
are no more.

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:12.780
So, I'll have to build a power cell charger and see where that gets me.

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:15.200
But in order to do that I need materials.

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:16.180
So!

00:03:16.820 --> 00:03:18.300
Back down we go.

00:03:18.540 --> 00:03:25.620
SO! All that bullsh*ttery aside, I'm headed back down into my base where I'm going to feel safe and home..

00:03:25.620 --> 00:03:27.060
and then I'm gonna build the lockers..

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:28.420
and put some new names on the wall.

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:31.240
And then I'm going to build the Modification Station..

00:03:31.240 --> 00:03:34.620
that I have so, desperately, fought for.

00:03:34.620 --> 00:03:38.100
You don't know the troubles that I've gone through.

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:40.160
Actually, you DO! You do know the troubles.

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:42.280
You know exactly the troubles that I've gone through!

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:44.400
And you know the lengths that I would go to..

00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:47.060
just in order to get a Modification Station!

00:03:47.420 --> 00:03:52.960
So, you know there's not gonna be anything that's gonna stop me from getting to the bottom of Subnautica!

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:55.500
Because they put a castle down there..

00:03:55.740 --> 00:04:00.580
And I may not get into it in this episode..
I may not get to it in the next episode.

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:04.120
But you better damn be sure that I'm gonna get to it soon!

00:04:04.520 --> 00:04:06.680
Nothing's gonna stand in my way!!

00:04:06.940 --> 00:04:10.780
And I'm getting back down to Bubblebutt, right about now.

00:04:12.220 --> 00:04:14.080
Ooh, how I missed you little buddy.

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:18.200
Oh, I'm SO SORRY  for the abuse that you ever endured!

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:20.120
I really feel bad!

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:23.280
I didn't mean for it to go so poorly for you, but...

00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:25.820
GOD DAMN, is it dark in here!

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:28.920
Let me just turn on my floodlights, because holy sh*t!

00:04:29.840 --> 00:04:33.500
Ah! that's much better. Everything's illuminated now. Especially...

00:04:33.820 --> 00:04:38.280
the fricken douchebags floating around there.. trying to warp me into places I don't want to be warped!

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:40.500
I know you're in the darkness...

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:42.280
I know you're down there!

00:04:42.520 --> 00:04:46.060
Also, it seems like they made a graphical update because everything seems to be much clearer.

00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:46.760
COFFEE!

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:47.380
f*ck!

00:04:47.380 --> 00:04:49.640
(machine voice) "You look like you could use some coffee"

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:51.900
I know I could, just give it in my mouth!

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:53.400
So! let's recap..

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:56.760
I need to make a MOD-I-FI-CATION Station.

00:04:57.560 --> 00:04:59.240
THANK YOU for the coffee.

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:03.380
I need to make a Modification Station and in order to do that..

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:06.060
I need A LOT of stuff!

00:05:06.560 --> 00:05:08.740
I need a wiring kit and a computer chip.

00:05:09.020 --> 00:05:11.460
Not, actually, all that much. SOOOOO...

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:14.360
If I look at my inventory I have nothing of that.

00:05:14.680 --> 00:05:16.960
But, if I look in here, I have titanium...

00:05:17.340 --> 00:05:19.600
I have copper...

00:05:20.640 --> 00:05:22.500
gol-uh-aaghh!

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:25.840
Ah! It's silver, hey hey! Things are looking up for me.

00:05:26.120 --> 00:05:27.100
I've got silver!

00:05:27.100 --> 00:05:28.420
And you know what that means!

00:05:28.420 --> 00:05:32.780
I get to build lockers!... which have nothing to do with the silver that I have, but I'll be right back.

00:05:32.900 --> 00:05:37.260
BLEBEDIBOPBAPADE....BOPBEEPBADABO

00:05:37.540 --> 00:05:42.980
OK! So we got Lapis Angsty Lazuli, which I think is a Steven Universe reference?..

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:49.140
who said, "Four hours and you still didn't cheat. We are so proud of you, or at least I am."

00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:51.220
And I want to say, thank you very much!

00:05:51.220 --> 00:05:52.580
I'm proud of myself.

00:05:52.720 --> 00:05:57.800
But NOT proud of myself for not flailing like an idiot and just giving up at the start of it.

00:05:57.860 --> 00:06:01.800
But I did it! That's the persistence that is the Markiplier way!

00:06:02.160 --> 00:06:10.940
Next up is SwagBird who said, "Mark didn't have an amazing reaction to all the futuristic stuff in the game. INSTEAD, he's crazy about the fact that you can make coffee!"

00:06:10.940 --> 00:06:14.440
Which is really cool, considering I need a lot of coffee!

00:06:14.460 --> 00:06:18.520
And then there's Lots Of Peeps... which just stands for a lot of you guys who said..

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:21.960
that apparently there's a bug in the wrecks.

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:27.500
And the problem that I was seeing before with absolutely nothing being there that I could scan..

00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:30.840
is actually a bug in the game and in order to see those things..

00:06:30.840 --> 00:06:34.920
I would have had to restart the game and then explore the space again.

00:06:34.920 --> 00:06:37.300
WELL!!! F*CK ME!

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:41.300
IT WAS A NEW UPDATE! I DIDN'T KNOW ABOUT IT!

00:06:41.600 --> 00:06:44.480
There was no way for me to find that OUT!

00:06:44.580 --> 00:06:47.560
So, I got F*CKED!

00:06:47.860 --> 00:06:49.860
And that's really cool, I guess.

00:06:50.020 --> 00:06:53.500
But.. c'est la vie! That is life, and life is that.

00:06:53.660 --> 00:06:56.880
So, now I'm going to make what I need to make.

00:06:56.880 --> 00:06:59.520
And that is a computer chip and a wiring kit.

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:03.100
I need Table Coral sample... which I don't know if it's down here?

00:07:03.100 --> 00:07:05.540
I think I've asked that very same question before...

00:07:05.540 --> 00:07:08.180
but, I'm pretty sure that I might be able to find it down here so I'm gonna...

00:07:08.480 --> 00:07:10.080
Maybe I already have it!?

00:07:10.080 --> 00:07:13.440
I should check that before I just go wandering off into the ocean!

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:16.600
THE ANSWER IS YEESSSS!

00:07:16.840 --> 00:07:19.040
I do have that, so that's good!

00:07:19.140 --> 00:07:25.680
I have that on store, which means that I don't need to go ANY-fricken-where to get what-EVER I need.

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:33.860
And that means that RIGHT HERE.. RIGHT NOW.. I get to make me a Modification Station.

00:07:34.140 --> 00:07:36.800
HOLY f*ckin sh*t!

00:07:37.380 --> 00:07:40.600
AAGGHHdabrasky!

00:07:41.200 --> 00:07:42.480
And with that...

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:46.860
the four hour journey has come to its end.

00:07:47.060 --> 00:07:54.280
And now that I have the Modification Station I can make all of these various types of upgrades..

00:07:54.420 --> 00:08:00.240
INCLUDING the Pressure compensator MK2 for the Seamoth and the Prawn..

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:03.360
which I am more specifically going to be using for the Prawn.

00:08:03.640 --> 00:08:07.720
AND, the Ultra Cyclops Reinforcement Module.

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:15.400
And if I go back to my Cyclops right now, I've got a whole mess of Plasteel ingots and Titanium ingots.

00:08:15.400 --> 00:08:19.060
And then, I'm pretty sure I've got Aluminum oxide crystals somwhere here.

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:20.180
Maybe?

00:08:20.360 --> 00:08:22.180
AH-HAHA! Gotcha!

00:08:22.220 --> 00:08:25.680
HAHA! I thought I wasn't gonna get ya, but then I got ya!

00:08:25.780 --> 00:08:27.060
So, I got that!

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:28.140
So,  that's good.

00:08:28.140 --> 00:08:29.840
Eh.. yeah, if you're wondering, yes..

00:08:29.840 --> 00:08:33.120
I may have lost a little piece of my mind in the last episode..

00:08:33.120 --> 00:08:35.920
but that doesn't mean that I'm not dedicated to going forward...

00:08:35.920 --> 00:08:37.760
and going deeper into the ocean..

00:08:37.760 --> 00:08:40.800
and having a great time among all my dead friends!

00:08:40.980 --> 00:08:43.280
AHAHAHAAAAAA!

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:44.340
Anyway..

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:45.520
anyway, so..

00:08:45.780 --> 00:08:47.140
now that I have that..

00:08:47.140 --> 00:08:50.220
I can make these upgrades but I gotta go into my, uh..

00:08:50.480 --> 00:08:53.700
I gotta go into my Big Box Barry for one second..

00:08:53.700 --> 00:08:54.260
woah!

00:08:54.700 --> 00:08:55.740
That was weird!

00:08:55.740 --> 00:08:58.640
I think they did do a graphical update because something seems..

00:08:59.160 --> 00:09:00.040
very diff---

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:01.640
can I please go into my..

00:09:01.900 --> 00:09:03.660
There we go.. Woahf! OK!

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:05.960
But something seems just a little bit different.

00:09:05.960 --> 00:09:08.420
But, I don't have time to worry about that right now.

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:14.980
I need to get all of the Plasteel ingots that I already have.. which is none!?

00:09:15.680 --> 00:09:17.040
I thought I had some!

00:09:17.100 --> 00:09:18.300
AAH, it dosn't matter!

00:09:18.460 --> 00:09:21.980
I'm gonna take all the Lithium that I got, which is a lot!

00:09:21.980 --> 00:09:26.900
And then, I'm gonna take all the Titanium ingots that I got.. which is A LOT!

00:09:26.900 --> 00:09:29.280
I'm gonna put the dead batteries that I got in here.

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:32.300
Someone said, I can't remember who, I saw this in passing..

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:39.620
but, somebody said that I can build a battery and/or... uh...

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:47.080
Power cell charger in my Big Box Barry and then use that to charge its own power cells..

00:09:47.220 --> 00:09:50.100
