00:09:50.320 --> 00:09:52.800
Now, I don't know how nice that seems?

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:58.080
That almost sounds like cheating to me, so I'm hesitant to do that!

00:09:58.080 --> 00:10:02.540
However, I am desperate, so... we'll see how things turn out.

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:06.720
I just don't want anything to do with cheating!

00:10:06.880 --> 00:10:12.580
I wanna be very dedicated, and cheating includes exploiting glitches...

00:10:12.860 --> 00:10:14.380
that is cheating!!

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:15.860
Oh, I forgot something... SORRY!

00:10:15.860 --> 00:10:19.820
I forgot, I forgot to actually pull the thing from the thing, so i'll.. hang on.

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:21.280
Ok, so I need this.

00:10:21.460 --> 00:10:26.260
Crush depth is 500 meters. Well that's ok, because I'm about to fix that!

00:10:26.500 --> 00:10:29.620
Because I need to bake A LOT of Plasteel ingots..

00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:32.200
and then I need to take those over to the, uh...

00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:36.500
the Modification Station and make a whole lot of sh*t!

00:10:36.700 --> 00:10:37.880
TOOYOUU!

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:41.620
The Warper's going nuts outside, but I don't care.

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:43.020
I'm safe in here...

00:10:43.340 --> 00:10:44.420
with my Plasteel.

00:10:44.420 --> 00:10:46.980
Who needs friends when you've got Plasteel!

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:49.540
Who needs friends when you've got a Modification Station!

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:53.540
Who needs friends when you've got a talking tree named Larry that can keep ya..

00:10:53.640 --> 00:10:56.160
keep ya company in the coldest of nights!

00:10:56.860 --> 00:10:57.800
Anyway..

00:10:58.080 --> 00:11:01.200
I'm looking at, 1-2-3-4-5-6.. I need ONE more!

00:11:01.480 --> 00:11:02.800
I need one more!

00:11:02.900 --> 00:11:06.040
I mean, I'm eventually gonna need more because I need to make the, uh...

00:11:06.300 --> 00:11:10.020
the Pressure compensators for my.. PRAWN suit as well.

00:11:10.020 --> 00:11:11.540
But, before I do that..

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:13.740
I need to make this!

00:11:14.120 --> 00:11:19.180
The ULTRA CYCLOPS REINFORCEMENT Module!

00:11:19.540 --> 00:11:22.860
And with this, I will be able to make whatever I--

00:11:22.860 --> 00:11:25.500
--or go down as far as I need to go.

00:11:25.640 --> 00:11:26.900
With the Cyclops, anyway.

00:11:26.960 --> 00:11:31.680
I do need to make it for the Prawn Suit before I'm able to go anywhere, BECAUSE..

00:11:32.180 --> 00:11:36.900
the Cyclops can only go as far as the vehicle docked within it.

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:40.100
So, that means if the Prawn Suit can only go to 900 meters..

00:11:40.100 --> 00:11:42.400
the Cyclops can't go any deeper than that.

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:46.760
But! For right now I'm gonna count my victories as they lay..

00:11:47.020 --> 00:11:49.380
and stick this right in this socket here.

00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:50.580
Habuski!

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:53.940
OH! 1500 METERS!!

00:11:54.500 --> 00:11:56.020
HOLY BALLS!!

00:11:56.120 --> 00:11:57.640
That's a lot of meters!

00:11:58.200 --> 00:12:00.280
So, with that being said..

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:04.320
let me just check to see if there's an Aluminum oxide crystal in here, because I need that.

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:06.340
Nope! Nothing in there!!

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:08.480
dodoDOH-Doh!

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:11.120
Doy! Hey, hey, don't look at me!

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:15.580
Ok! So I got that and my Cyclops is now crushed down to 1500 meters..

00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:20.260
but the only problem is, I need to be able to make these other upgrades and to do that..

00:12:20.700 --> 00:12:26.080
I need a computer chip and two Aluminum oxide crystals.

00:12:26.280 --> 00:12:28.060
Not just one, I need two!

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:33.780
Oh NO!.. Oh no, that's fine. I need a computer chip and than I need Aluminum oxide crystal.

00:12:33.940 --> 00:12:36.280
I believe... I'm not sure.

00:12:36.280 --> 00:12:38.980
I don't think I have another Aluminum oxide crystal.

00:12:39.340 --> 00:12:41.700
I'm pretty sure I do not have that.

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:44.160
Yeah...

00:12:44.760 --> 00:12:48.240
But I do have... I'm pretty sure I saw it.

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:48.740
Yeah!

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:53.340
I've got one more silver.. just one! But I've got it.

00:12:53.560 --> 00:12:56.200
So that means.. ahh, sh*t, the Table coral!

00:12:56.340 --> 00:12:57.300
GOD DAMN IT!!

00:12:57.940 --> 00:12:59.360
F*CK MEEE!!

00:12:59.580 --> 00:13:00.080
Ok...

00:13:00.240 --> 00:13:02.740
so, what I got to do is I have to make...

